7. Get the maximum and minimum salary.
--> SELECT MAX(salary) AS maximum_salary, MIN(salary) AS minimum_salary FROM employees;
Output:
+----------------+----------------+
| maximum_salary | minimum_salary |
+----------------+----------------+
| 24000.00       | 2100.00        |
+----------------+----------------+

8. Get the average salary and number of employees.
--> SELECT AVG(salary) AS average_salary, COUNT(*) AS number_of_employees FROM employees;
Output:
+----------------+---------------------+
| average_salary | number_of_employees |
+----------------+---------------------+
| 6461.68        | 107                 |
+----------------+---------------------+

9. Get the number of employees working with the company.
--> SELECT COUNT(*) AS total_employees FROM employees;
